  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A drone with a mass of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"5.0 \\text{ kg}\"></span> is programmed to perform a vertical ascent. The total upward thrust <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F\"></span> generated by its rotors is measured at various times <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t\"></span>, as shown in the data table below.</p>\n<table><thead><tr><th><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t\"></span> / s</th><th>Thrust <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F\"></span> / N</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>0.0</td><td>50</td></tr><tr><td>1.0</td><td>65</td></tr><tr><td>2.0</td><td>65</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>What is the acceleration of the drone during the interval from <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t = 1.0 \\text{ s}\"></span> to <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t = 2.0 \\text{ s}\"></span>?<br/>(Assume <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"g = 10 \\text{ m\\,s}^{-2}\"></span>)</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"3.0 \\text{ m\\,s}^{-2}\"></span> downwards</p></li><li data-label=\"B\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"3.0 \\text{ m\\,s}^{-2}\"></span> upwards</p></li><li data-label=\"C\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"13.0 \\text{ m\\,s}^{-2}\"></span> upwards</p></li><li data-label=\"D\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"1.3 \\text{ m\\,s}^{-2}\"></span> upwards</p></li></ol>"
  },
